### Login (JWT for the protected /api/** calls below)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jwt.gate@eh8s.local",
  "password": "eh8s-dev-pass1"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Geo build without Bearer must be 401
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/geo-subscriptions/1/subscribe-geographic/build
Content-Type: application/json

{ "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC" }

### Build per-song deposit_royalties (409 until the song pool is activated; see SongRoyalty.http)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/royalty-deposits/1/deposit-royalties/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC" }

### Reject deposit confirm without txSignature (400, or 409 while the song pool is inactive)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/royalty-deposits/1/deposit-royalties/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC" }

### Geo regions with their on-chain zone codes (MEX, MEX_CDMX)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/geo-regions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a Global tier geo subscription in MEX-CDMX for 2 months (geoCode defaults to MEX_CDMX)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/geo-subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bandId": 1, "geoTierId": 5, "geoRegionId": 2, "months": 2 }

> {% client.global.set("geoId", response.body.id); %}

### A finer zone under the region is accepted (MEX_CDMX_CENTRO)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/geo-subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bandId": 1, "geoTierId": 2, "geoRegionId": 2, "geoCode": "MEX_CDMX_CENTRO", "months": 1 }

### A zone outside the region must be 400
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/geo-subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bandId": 1, "geoTierId": 2, "geoRegionId": 2, "geoCode": "USA_NYC", "months": 1 }

### Build subscribe_geographic("MEX_CDMX", tier=5, months=2): amount 198, PDA ["geo_sub", wallet, geo_code] = Hq6qFviJPdrRsA6rvxXBBALw13cqTsa5zeaU2KLyzKQp
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/geo-subscriptions/{{geoId}}/subscribe-geographic/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "amountUsdc": 1.00
}

### Confirm with the pre-v0.9.0 ["geo_sub", wallet] PDA must be 400
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/geo-subscriptions/{{geoId}}/subscribe-geographic/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "txSignature": "5xNotARealSignature111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111",
  "geographicSubscriptionPda": "6nL9F7b7vc7568C2VDeSXsqwmGZdC5tQyxHnemRDkA9S"
}

### Reject geo confirm without txSignature (must not mark paid)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/geo-subscriptions/{{geoId}}/subscribe-geographic/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "geographicSubscriptionPda": "Hq6qFviJPdrRsA6rvxXBBALw13cqTsa5zeaU2KLyzKQp"
}

### Zone status read live from DevNet (ATLAS gate): exists=false until the wallet subscribes
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/geo-zones/MEX_CDMX/status?wallet=7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid zone code must be 400
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/geo-zones/mex-cdmx/status?wallet=7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### On-chain status of an unconfirmed geo subscription must be 409
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/geo-subscriptions/{{geoId}}/onchain
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
